WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:34.766
Excellent at filling blanks. Good at search?

00:00:34.766 --> 00:01:11.216
CBOW: predict the word from its neighbours

00:01:11.216 --> 00:01:44.673
Masked prediction: context on both sides

00:01:44.673 --> 00:02:20.962
Next-token prediction: the future is hidden

00:02:20.962 --> 00:02:57.098
Language, domain, and retrieval are separate jobs

00:02:57.098 --> 00:03:39.350
Knowing the domain does not specify the ranking

00:03:39.350 --> 00:04:11.925
The same model family can do different jobs

00:04:11.925 --> 00:04:49.133
Ask what it learnt—and where it is used
